# Project Context System

This project uses Codemap for workflow coordination. All guidance is automatically composed from context files and injected into your AI assistant's prompt based on your current work.

## How This Works
- You're working in an ephemeral branch specific to this bug
- Context is assembled from: ROOT → PROJECT → STAGE → BUG
- The current stage guides what to do next

## Getting Help
- `git-codemap wtf` - See current context, bug, and quick commands
- `git-codemap bug show` - See current bug status and stage (auto-detected)
- `git-codemap transition <stage>` - Move to a workflow stage
- Bug content contains specific requirements and progress notes

## Workflow Overview
Bugs progress through stages: DISCUSSION → ARCHITECTURE → IMPLEMENTATION → TESTING → MERGE

Each stage provides specific guidance on what to do and when you're ready to move forward.
